<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="63a86abb797d4fb4be4feea47dd729a1">分层场景：决策加工组件</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="ab5360a06373421d8cbfb894aaa210d2" />
<km-note type="tip" nodeId="c269a9ad69b148d9a6b77201a51b101f">
<km-title>预期六月初，分层场景将升级决策加工组件为分层场景-决策树，支持复杂决策合并自定义编排，原决策加工组件将下线。</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="d1d63f62bab4468898fa0fdbd29e2920"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/99566485182?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="785" height="429" nodeId="87458f45f14749b5babe71f490f56c8b" /></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<h1 nodeId="7f971da6290b4964b8e676f171400888">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="9eb588e78ba74e3cb668c5f2a2416814"><span font-size="15">当前决策输出的一些现状总结如下：</span></p>
<ul nodeId="39c1fa74d80944f3970e26688dbe8e54">
<li nodeId="87aeda4b02b242828bffc005bf696ad1"><span font-size="15">Zeus现支持规则执行结果的实时返回，但对于一个请求下执行多条规则会返回多个决策，即决策list。业务侧需要自己进行决策信息的汇总、合并以及取唯一值。对于通过Tatooine接入Zeus的业务（交易、账户、UGC等），由Tatooine提供固定的决策合并服务。但对于这部分用户来说，决策汇总逻辑是黑盒的，都在研发的硬编码中，进而导致涉及决策异常的排查定位困难、时间长。</span></li>
<li nodeId="b4f3f22dcbbc438584dc32c762487abb"><span font-size="15">对于部分策略团队（如账户），过去使用【规则优先级+组合决策】的模式，在想要调整最终输出决策时，不够灵活。比如难以解决验证决策的可验性再下发，难以解决不同风险域下决策优先级高低不同的问题。</span></li>
<li nodeId="5aea997bba6946b991468f8d6d2b519c"><span font-size="15">另外，在分层场景中，在补偿链路执行命中的拦截，已无法给实时链路输出，希望能转化为执行「踢出登录态」等异步动作对实时链路中放行的流量进行补偿处置。</span></li>
</ul>
<h1 nodeId="f4c20b8f10e543899419530968c2948a">二、名词解释</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="b0c3769d06024a49bb69ec193fea3628">
<tr nodeId="fa3ba03bb21248248f8f81484ae8410f">
<th colwidth="[107]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="86faa9d7e2a74628a4647867518a859a">
<p nodeId="0b941eb8b68c46948f78473dd13edd66"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="15">名词</span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[915]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="0f54370681f8444688eb1a345eab2752">
<p nodeId="99c62b04e7c949559bde9c6b51755d2d"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="15">解释</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="1064c4877bda4e4d9d2d471be2d0fee9">
<td colwidth="[107]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="8f2390c2982347d3aeed15c58bc47b4e">
<p align="start" nodeId="2f5650de601c407fa067240cfa3041eb"><span font-size="15"><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1333731150" title="分层场景" nodeId="a3cccb6b791445a795af9aa10f746803"><strong>分层场景</strong></a></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[915]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="e120da74e9f14f8e96cb22e3b5d56ecc">
<p align="start" nodeId="229f80a3a7044911969473dd765cfc6a"><span font-size="15">新的规则集合实体，对标过去一个普通场景，在场景内支持以层级关系+路由条件组织成树状的执行链路，使场景内策略达到分层执行的效果。因超时（或短路）未执行的链路将获得</span><span font-size="15"><strong>补偿</strong></span><span font-size="15">。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="aa3d0b74af8641768d7bd1c1c2d0f357">
<td colwidth="[107]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="eea069898b6c47cf8f156f0674bc5249">
<p align="start" nodeId="75552b455ead4be891e4b1506ad2d133"><span font-size="15"><strong>决策加工</strong></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[915]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="2621f624c388450e84cd1b64f88a5b0b">
<p align="start" nodeId="cac25bbde2f84df8b3b60ba05233c30c"><span font-size="15">分层场景里的一种组件，各策略节点执行输出的决策，都将汇总于决策加工组件进行统一加工输出</span></p>
<p nodeId="60b8c845d86a48b7b6758c14edbd93e2"><span font-size="15">对整个分层场景各个节点输出的决策进行统一合并、过滤等处理。可在组件内选择加工模式、设置补偿决策（实时链路中因短路/超时未输出的普通决策，若在补偿链路命中，则可以转化为异步决策进行补偿输出）。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="293804a63bc24d3da16539491aa4810a">三、使用指南</h1>
<h2 nodeId="5ebc1744b3714a638e233a0f8950ef20">3.1 添加决策加工组件</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="354e3f36b143419fb52f1ee74c920e1d">
<tr nodeId="5258923792244d6798fdcd857649c7f7">
<th colwidth="[631]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="aa648cee7303467cbfbb73b580e1a281">
<p nodeId="303b3e498de34f939bb24a8935f150f8"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14"><strong>说明</strong></span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[607]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="51149b36ec64481a87dd74602efe6e1f">
<p nodeId="7cb70076725346e8a855651696d832e9"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14">图</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="c4d1d15b75e14ebbbb4b58eaccb116d5">
<td colwidth="[631]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="c88521ffe49543afa0df527f3fe22ed8">
<p nodeId="6ac0cf6d01d34f0abeacaab5f1bc6f0c">进入分层场景编辑态</p>
<p nodeId="906370b22a574515b530b8f2d4d15706">拖动决策加工组件到画布空白区域，即可完成添加。</p>
<p nodeId="f19746e9b6c445a286da5dd80d2f7309">添加完成后在画布左上角形成固定区域——决策加工区，可点击组件编辑详细内容（可根据需要拉宽）</p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="cb8daa9e7961428a9eae43e304f3aad7">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="938b6cb6b03043ce91d4ae03a0b2b651">一个分层场景至多使用1个决策加工组件，因此拖出去后工具栏中的决策加工组件消失。如果想弃用加工组件，可以右键决策加工区，点击删除。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="6d002eb874264f5e8c0325765e068f53">
<p nodeId="7ea96924008643e88e0522e8f692edd6"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/31328226607?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="289" height="150" nodeId="6686961e4ae34ef3baf1a40d34ee6626" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/31330796882?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="283" height="156" nodeId="bdb8af673e3041ec8ea6bdaef064e998" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 nodeId="a87e1d93784440c2b3546c15ce1c35ff">3.2 决策加工逻辑</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="c675520e17d449d69319b8ec4952af20">
<tr nodeId="ee9c153270fa4f2d91069302ba944023">
<th colwidth="[631]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="c0a52acb0803442d8feac8e46ebe0601">
<p nodeId="6cacce87e9174c93ad54413d2b1cbdd2"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14"><strong>说明</strong></span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[607]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="692de1de99f440eb9da5a4a9eabfb8b7">
<p nodeId="4bbef6e4557049ec95d8c6341fb6f1af"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14">图</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="383dd1422a744bc8a76f44b35e5d0bc5">
<td colwidth="[631]" nodeId="f2a9c16787e146eebe8d95ce4d75e217">
<p nodeId="103a32e448094a6eb474bb2dc76ba552">组件详情中选择决策加工逻辑：单决策or组合决策</p>
<p nodeId="e82b8fb83d2d4cf5981cecc69e6075e5">合并依据：决策优先级</p>
<p nodeId="78568dce3bd94fdd9680783d334c745d">合并对象：分层场景中的所有决策</p>
<p nodeId="ee58fa5dade04c43a36697bb7f7293a3">合并模式：单决策模式 / 组合模式</p>
<p nodeId="814f0ccab3a44a1bb4eacc913bcd7945" />
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="91b4b62fce164619a3f1df93c1bff12f">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="daadbb964e8148b38049716ad350fb19">平台给每个业务空间默认选择了1种合并模式。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="079f5e64b75041c19eeeb06688292e4e">1.不启用：命中规则对应的决策全输出，返回调用方决策List和所有命中details</p>
<p nodeId="7845c16298c548829460f57146b42213" />
<p nodeId="2e81254e5a544a7784da8e1c30a84357">2.单决策模式：</p>
<ul nodeId="f6b23474b6814557be9f101a87f35dfc">
<li nodeId="4ff92efaba364eb4aec6eef27c77c509">获取命中生效规则的决策</li>
<li nodeId="90c2f18319eb462c8cf1cd6f8969ea30">去重</li>
<li nodeId="aee3f309df3a4afdb753e2e322e5ae36">取优先级最高优先级决策</li>
<li nodeId="49487c2ac4ad43a782d0eaea42161244">相同优先级随机取1个</li>
<li nodeId="6416348b1fea45e19560b9b6ddb71e5f">返回单决策和所有命中details</li>
</ul>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="66aa953a6d844feeac579835efaecf95">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="0050508f107b426a8ef4965b84972e7e">适用于：交易安全、UGC营销、内容安全</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="edb4ddaea22c41bdb3a5e0ada6254394" />
<p nodeId="862dceb3c9e24b4584f334d2cb21ba39">3.组合模式：</p>
<ul nodeId="e2b7ffb6f2b542a0b319e5de92921d4e">
<li nodeId="e4f1b4ccf70c4f21af34be6edadb5696">获取命中生效规则的决策</li>
<li nodeId="0afbdcc2f3d848539def8fbdb6dde2ac">组合决策拆分（如有配组合决策的话）</li>
<li nodeId="510231f7b6f643f38d2b9bee87388f0d">Yoda可验证性过滤<km-footnote id="6d7b26dc-6135-45d5-b259-fc1fe4c88679" annotate="" nodeId="d904f81844094abb88635dd746ea2a10" /></li>
<li nodeId="8c0f2b137fa3451d98f96c75d627531e">取优先级最高优先级决策</li>
<li nodeId="8b5e8a3b11ef4f93bae4ef49c8bf94c6">相同优先级则都取</li>
<li nodeId="7bc8afbcaf8849879aefadfa4b12a77d">决策拼接：<span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">先按照同规则一组，将决策分好组，组内（即来自同规则）用“，”拼接，有重复则去除。组间（来自不同规则）用“｜”连接，若两组内容完全一致，则去重。</span></li>
<li nodeId="56b62a3886644d7893ffcfa4334aa632">返回拼接决策和所有命中details</li>
</ul>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="c05d9bd11484430caa8ba72e20b3f5f3">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="3b0e715152e94273bf99c6e7802abdf8">适用于：账户安全</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="15c51d39b18f4e4ba43f0ce56b28c6a7">
<p nodeId="fdb1ed98b286409b826a9c9976f8e9c9"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/14374774262?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="993" height="600" nodeId="25a59c0b4ee047a2b260c40e335ee188" /></p>
<p nodeId="b79d6c52fc2448679def3a731e18a6ea">单决策模式 执行逻辑</p>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/31340824967?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="1246" height="556" nodeId="3c0c210c98c147009558d51f2b5a3b24" />
<p nodeId="45aa2547d57c433db7a3c7d63819c33b"><km-quote quoteId="1409924045--30f8ac3b-cd85-4bce-89c4-6e384b0f40b9">组合模式 执行逻辑</km-quote></p>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/31339835656?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="1528" height="786" nodeId="b859f443ddb045cc8f596e07a620ab3a" />
</td>
</tr>
