<h2 nodeId="cd397deb6a44454a8e37d6e2c076763d">3.3 决策合并单点测试</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="2b9814145ea04bc28fa2182117ebadf6">
<tr nodeId="782c466bd8f2401d9ed32233ae4a67ab">
<th colwidth="[631]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="8241241156e042d280aa449be4be6239">
<p nodeId="7215f822bdc34b3b9878eef5ae987023"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14"><strong>说明</strong></span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[607]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="690c55d08b5e490ab50d33b738405c50">
<p nodeId="b6f87669a3f646059b18cbf45060a1c3"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14">图</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="36b459ece5584800a6ee756702c6a59f">
<td colwidth="[631]" nodeId="f493f2e0702b4cb8bfd9b0b56b3ac818">
<p nodeId="04723807fa264baca34f0d8379559430">为什么要进行单点测试？</p>
<p nodeId="b554f3fb8f144f4a9e36d1c2d24f88ae">——对决策加工组件的能力进行mock，测试执行逻辑是否符合预期</p>
<p nodeId="bb87370cdf1b44dd81690fc141c3a6b8">如何进行单点测试？</p>
<p nodeId="9bffdeea05e948cfba17b2fc0b112712">——在逻辑测试中点击【决策加工逻辑测试】</p>
<ul nodeId="a6825874da0a45c4bb803bed59bc9213">
<li nodeId="948d5deb9bc245b599aa03a87923e873">添加用例：模拟 场景命中的规则以及产出的<u>决策id</u>，可点击【+】添加多条</li>
<li nodeId="148c7190ed924c33a7c594deecf201ae">期望输出：在普通决策和异步决策（<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">概念见</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813#id-%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%90%8D%E8%AF%8D%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813#id-%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%90%8D%E8%AF%8D%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="65d94dfa11e640bf91c180106c5a88a4">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1608157813#id-%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%90%8D%E8%AF%8D%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A</a>）中分别填入目标输出，多个请用英文“,”连接。若目标为空，则不需要填入。若为单决策模式，普通决策是单个决策ID；若为组合模式，普通决策请根据合并逻辑输入用 "," 或 "|" 连接的决策ID串。</li>
<li nodeId="4c72a28bbb80431da55cf165c2276c66">⚠️ 决策过滤：账户安全默认的组合模式下，实际会执行Yoda可验证性过滤，因此此处支持用户模拟需要过滤掉的决策list。用英文“,”连接决策id，这些决策将在合并前被剔除。剩下的决策才会参与合并。</li>
<li nodeId="70e7ea72130f49ea94deed1a3316c4f3">获取测试结果：点击获取测试结果，将告知本次模拟是否符合预期，测试是否成功。下方可以查看当前测试的实际输出结果。</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="8eb78875491a42bc8a2c50f69a9ac2e8">
<p nodeId="137c54a025bf4ceca00d72b852ad0abc"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1409924045/14384304629?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="696" height="600" nodeId="8be2dd01ef9c4f7582a13e872b9cda6d" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 nodeId="669cf4923f5644caa340dc1520b34294">3.4 补偿决策</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="6f96be12007749aaa54e8c4e983dedc6">
<tr nodeId="30931ca995914a5487f9c1fe4d9bd629">
<th colwidth="[693]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="6be01a8ea3224d44a84aea0475546675">
<p nodeId="5b6c6b1a021640538cf5e45079b493c5"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14"><strong>说明</strong></span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[607]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="fa964cac4f494faf9349132246302c10">
<p nodeId="cf289530e62c4c399132a776693656b8"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="14">图</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="54c9acbe1f2f4bed9580a21984e26f7a">
<td colwidth="[693]" nodeId="48f60c9bcbe24e0cb8d1a4a1d20bc676">
<p nodeId="0ad996a2de7c4e738da111ad887d6472"><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1610062169" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1610062169" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="0bb1cb55bb914264abe9e20356514101">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1610062169</a><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">中，命中的【普通决策】无法输出给调用方。因为实时链路中的普通决策结果已经实时下发了，补偿链路在异步执行完后再下发【普通决策】输出无意义。</span></p>
<p nodeId="4d62d85d3fa3498e85919687addb5ff6"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">因此补偿链路中如果识别到了风险，产出的【普通决策】会期望能够以其他方式追加作用给下游。比如将【拦截】（普通决策）转化为【踢出登陆态】（异步决策）。——</span><span color="#FF4A47">此时【踢出登陆态】就是【拦截】的【补偿决策】</span></p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="b0bba16bbb7048c18f4299d67e5b6586">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="130e8be9301e49b197f1c4ee264ab2f1">【例子】</p>
<p nodeId="facb076dcf014536ba1c8aca6b173765"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">账户在【实时链路】中某条策略的决策配置【拦截】</span></p>
<p nodeId="d6df1223e7c149e1a422c4df580869e7"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">（from</span>策略节点--规则配置<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">）</span></p>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="8edd7112486a474896841dd1affbb3d9">
<tr nodeId="9902538887284ed695317954f73314fa">
<th colwidth="[108]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="8cfd220a60ab476fba4b27affa98f738">
<p nodeId="5c31b93e9729449c920ace657058e092"><span color="">规则</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[92]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="1f4eca1b1c914481ab46b692b0a12e65">
<p nodeId="73707fc898f343a095ef128bc8d1e512">决策</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[89]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="46bd569de830434183e43eca3d08e3e6">
<p nodeId="100ae3971d5d4b9c8e2f4be3335e35ed">附加信息</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[62]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="ce343cc1f629403bacfc7a61f39a7086">
<p nodeId="ce6d24f5e8314fd0acd9ec2eede7aa95">状态</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="b93502bbcd61425cb945f42b240c7427">
<td colwidth="[108]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="fefafcc81b204567a0f05138adf99762">
<p align="start" nodeId="b8016ef0bb604ffa812a06772c61f51d">盗号规则xxx</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[92]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="827c6a6677ae49c8a08d1c596cf6a6ae">
<p align="start" nodeId="cd71201ac67a4ad58ee17dbc5d72a613">拦截</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[89]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="afd63c1ee1ff4f50a0030e6159d3df3a">
<p align="start" nodeId="4d75adaf871443288d40f779d6e7e5bc">无</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[62]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="4a6f23cfd80545ba8543794c98df0876">
<p align="start" nodeId="b3ab7087f6a047408714a180882611f8">生效</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p nodeId="2d42de6bdbaa4901b609520abb6b68bb"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">但是因为超时没执行到，实时链路实际【放行】了。规则在补偿链路中执行产出了【拦截】，但已经无法给到下游。</span><br /><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">那么根据配置好的补偿决策【踢出登陆态】 进行执行：</span></p>
<p nodeId="c9fd0346a2244294835ce0dc7bc0cb3f">（from 决策加工组件--补偿配置）</p>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="f08544e3c022416e9ad88fa31253bc4d">
<tr nodeId="bdf1a9fc28244e85b553f42e5a4c73af">
<th colwidth="[84]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="863b4542e0ac437589172dec36e8bb9a">
<p nodeId="6a6c4001e97d4d9eaf42e4256c668c4e"><span color="">普通决策</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[114]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="0c10e7cccba249ceae60fc46cd1826bc">
<p nodeId="2a61adc9101a4eff8bcbcfe01da7c37d">补偿决策</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[89]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="cb60f49872ef45d3b9276884ead380fd">
<p nodeId="d151d7d7fd7d476ea392077b19c99007">附加信息</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="c6ee2c4586ad44adb6b5f6c8bc98838d">
<td colwidth="[84]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="ffc46bc5870b4ee9af1994c1dc1c408f">
<p align="start" nodeId="362d739efa8d413eafc0e635cb97f114">拦截</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[114]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="5ca235968d34404eb1b09f40956619b7">
<p align="start" nodeId="4e72411b664543f4944533b5a87c0c6f">踢出登陆态</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[89]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="ab2be142c9714e95bc89842a025435d8">
<p align="start" nodeId="348130590a9d45f4b6565714c946e9f6">userid……</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p nodeId="6f421dd75e634667b17e722376c96d72">效果上，风险用户整个旅程为：存在有风险的登陆操作，但是被放行，成功登陆。紧接着不久，就被异步踢出了登录态，阻止了后续的风险。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="a57266a48e354b9a97a92a5aed94da4c">根据上述介绍，结合几类决策特点可知，只有【普通决策】才会需要配置补偿；而只有【异步决策】才可作为【补偿决策】进行配置；</p>
<p nodeId="e474fccfd06647339be28e4da7eda2da"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">配置方式：补偿决策-点击【增加】，在决策列下拉 选择此分层场景中的具体1个普通决策（或组合决策），为其配置对应的补偿决策（下拉选择一个异步决策）。</span></p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="69f299638ce74c8fb747dee0520d3373">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="356c9f5dad634e1c9e6933070d586b2e">在提交配置的时候会进行冲突校验。不允许各个普通决策（组合决策）配置的补偿有冲突。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[607]" nodeId="a616ca2cdd444977ba8bbd55751bebcd">
